 {
  "id": "620.5.1-001",
  "section": "620.5.1",
  "domain": "620.5",
  "stem": "你想找出「指派給別人」以及「還沒指派」的 issue。哪個 JQL 正確？",
  "options": [
   "assignee != currentUser() OR assignee IS EMPTY",
   "assignee = EMPTY AND assignee = currentUser()",
   "assignee NOT IN (currentUser(), EMPTY)",
   "assignee != currentUser()"
  ],
  "answer": "A",
  "explain": {
   "D": "!= 不會匹配空值，未指派的會被漏掉。",
   "A": "用 OR 明確補上 IS EMPTY。",
   "B": "兩個條件互斥，永遠無結果。",
   "C": "EMPTY 不能放在 IN 清單裡。"
  },
  "sources": [
   "https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/",
   "https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-keywords/"
  ],
  "tags": [
