   "D": "限定六個欄位。",
   "A": "官方原句：This operator can be used with the Assignee, Fix Version, Priority, Reporter, Resolution, and Status fields only。另注意變更筆數過多時 WAS 只搜尋最近的變更。",
   "B": "不只 Status。",
   "C": "自訂欄位不支援。"
