 {
  "id": "620.5.1-019",
  "section": "620.5.1",
  "domain": "620.5",
  "stem": "要用 JQL 找出所有「sub-task 層級」的工作，現行官方文件記載的寫法是？",
  "options": [
   "issuetype IN subtaskIssueTypes()",
   "parent IS NOT EMPTY",
   "hierarchyLevel = -1",
   "hierarchyLevel = 0"
  ],
  "answer": "C",
  "explain": {
   "C": "官方 JQL fields 頁記載 hierarchyLevel：story 層是 0、sub-task 層是 -1（範例 hierarchyLevel > -1 意為「高於 subtask 層」），所以 sub-task 寫 hierarchyLevel = -1。",
   "D": "0 是 standard（story／task／bug）層，不是 sub-task。",
   "A": "subtaskIssueTypes()／standardIssueTypes() 是舊有寫法，現行 Cloud 的 JQL 函數參考頁已未列出，不要當成官方答案。",
   "B": "parent 有值的不只 sub-task；掛在 epic 底下的 story 也有 parent，範圍過寬。"
  },
  "sources": [
   "https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-fields/",
   "https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"
  ],
  "tags": [
   "jql",
   "hierarchy",
   "sub-task"
  ],
  "difficulty": 1,
  "version_note": "現行官方 JQL 函數頁未列 subtaskIssueTypes()／standardIssueTypes()；hierarchyLevel 有官方欄位說明與範例。",
  "origin": "new"
 },
